OL,3,GNEWSAArchbishop visits county for
OL,4,Aanniversary
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Archbishop of Canterbury, Dame
OL,7,FSarah Mullally, has visited Shropshire
OL,8,Fas part of celebrations marking the
OL,9,F1,350th anniversary of the Hereford
OL,10,FDiocese.
OL,12,FDame Sarah spent time meeting
OL,13,Fcommunities across the county on
OL,14,FSunday, alongside the Bishop of
OL,15,FHereford, the Right Reverend Richard
OL,16,FJackson.
OL,18,FHer visit included a stop at a farm in
OL,19,FAdforton, where she met members of the
OL,20,Ffarming community.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
