OL,3,GNEWSAArchbishop visits county for
OL,4,Aanniversary
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe also attended celebrations for lay
OL,7,Fministry at St Lawrence's Church in
OL,8,FLudlow, witnessed 40 baptisms and
OL,9,Fconfirmations, and visited youth hubs
OL,10,Fin Leominster.
